        "status": "active",
        "termId": "norn.plan.spread.target",
        "termKind": "class"
      },
      {
        "definition": "An atomic merchandise plan line at entity x store x category x brand x ISO month grain with additive flow targets and semi-additive EOM stock, disjoint from actuals.",
